{"seq":2,"slug":"device-fingerprint-identity-graph","title":"设备指纹技术与设备身份图谱构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/account-takeover-credential-stuffing-bot-defense/login-bot-detection-fingerprint/device-fingerprint-identity-graph","wordCount":3782,"readingTime":16,"html":"<h1 id=\"设备指纹技术与设备身份图谱构建\">设备指纹技术与设备身份图谱构建</h1><p>撞库者会换 IP、换 UA、换代理池，但同一批攻击里那台跑脚本的机器往往在指纹上露馅：Canvas 渲染出的渐变像素一致、字体枚举顺序一致、时区与地理对不上。设备指纹的价值就在这一步——它把「这个请求像不像人」的问题，转成「这个请求与历史上哪台设备、哪个账号、哪张卡有关」的问题。而单个指纹只是一个孤立的点；真正把撞库、养号、盗卡串成一条线的是<strong>设备身份图谱</strong>：把指纹、账号、邮箱、手机、IP、支付工具连成一张带权图，在图上做风险扩散。本文讲这条从熵源采集到图谱判定的完整链路，以及在跨境电商这种天然多国、多代理、多设备场景里的做法与合规边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-指纹是概率-图谱是聚合器\">核心概念：指纹是概率，图谱是聚合器</h2><p>设备指纹（device fingerprinting）是从客户端可观测属性中抽取一组特征，用于估计「两个请求来自同一物理设备」的概率。注意这里是<strong>概率</strong>而非身份：指纹由 Canvas 哈希、WebGL 渲染器串、AudioContext 浮点尾数、字体枚举、<code>hardwareConcurrency</code>、屏幕参数、时区等熵源组合而来，任何一项都可能因浏览器升级、驱动更新、隐私策略收紧而漂移。工程上必须把它当作一个相似度函数，而不是一个主键。</p>\n<p>设备身份图谱把孤立指纹升级成关系结构。节点是实体（设备、账号、邮箱、手机、IP/ASN、支付工具），边是「同一事件中被同时观测到」的证据；一次登录就是一个超边，拆成若干条 pairwise 边并各自赋权。撞库集群在<strong>单点</strong>上刻意做得正常——住宅代理轮换 IP、真实 UA 池、指纹喷洒（fingerprint spoofing）让一台机器呈现多个指纹——但它在<strong>拓扑</strong>上很难同时正常：一个账号短时间登录 200 台设备，或一台设备关联 300 个账号，这种度分布异常只在聚合层可见。</p>\n<p>两者的分工可以这样概括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>单点设备指纹</th>\n<th>设备身份图谱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>回答的问题</td>\n<td>这两个请求是否同一设备</td>\n<td>这些实体是否同一控制者/同一团伙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据形态</td>\n<td>特征向量 + 相似度</td>\n<td>多部图 + 带权边 + 社区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要熵源</td>\n<td>Canvas/WebGL/Audio/字体/Client Hints</td>\n<td>共享账号、支付工具、ASN、会话序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗规避能力</td>\n<td>中（可伪造、可喷洒）</td>\n<td>高（伪造关系成本高）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型失效</td>\n<td>浏览器反指纹导致熵下降</td>\n<td>图爆炸成单一巨型连通分量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对外可解释性</td>\n<td>弱（「你像机器人」）</td>\n<td>强（「此账号与已知欺诈设备同 IP 段」）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把多源证据合成边权时，最稳妥的做法不是加权求和，而是<strong>对数似然比（LLR）</strong>，因为它对每个证据的误报率敏感、可解释、可在线更新：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>same</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>diff</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{LLR}(e)=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\log\\frac{P\\!\\left(x_i \\mid \\text{same}\\right)}{P\\!\\left(x_i \\mid \\text{diff}\\right)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">LLR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diff</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">same</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>LLR 大于阈值才建边：<code>Canvas 相似度=0.97</code> 与 <code>同 IP 段</code> 叠加出的置信度，不等于两者各自的小幅加分，而是可量化的证据叠加，且能被风控分析师逐项复核。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[登录请求] --&gt; B[客户端指纹采集&lt;br/&gt;Canvas/WebGL/Audio/字体]&#10;    A --&gt; C[服务端信号&lt;br/&gt;JA4/HTTP2 帧序/IP 信誉]&#10;    B --&gt; D[特征归一化与相似度]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[实体解析&lt;br/&gt;生成/匹配节点]&#10;    E --&gt; F[边打分 LLR]&#10;    F --&gt; G[图存储与连通分量]&#10;    G --&gt; H[社区检测与标签扩散]&#10;    H --&gt; I[风险标签回写会话]&#10;    I --&gt; J{分级响应}&#10;    J -- 高置信 --&gt; K[挑战或封禁]&#10;    J -- 中置信 --&gt; L[提升阶梯认证]&#10;    J -- 低置信 --&gt; M[继续观察]\">graph TD\n    A[登录请求] --&gt; B[客户端指纹采集&lt;br/&gt;Canvas/WebGL/Audio/字体]\n    A --&gt; C[服务端信号&lt;br/&gt;JA4/HTTP2 帧序/IP 信誉]\n    B --&gt; D[特征归一化与相似度]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[实体解析&lt;br/&gt;生成/匹配节点]\n    E --&gt; F[边打分 LLR]\n    F --&gt; G[图存储与连通分量]\n    G --&gt; H[社区检测与标签扩散]\n    H --&gt; I[风险标签回写会话]\n    I --&gt; J{分级响应}\n    J -- 高置信 --&gt; K[挑战或封禁]\n    J -- 中置信 --&gt; L[提升阶梯认证]\n    J -- 低置信 --&gt; M[继续观察]</pre><h2 id=\"指纹熵源与稳定性分层\">指纹熵源与稳定性分层</h2><p>不是熵源越多越好，而是要按<strong>漂移速度</strong>分层，对不同层采用不同的更新与聚合策略。2026 年的现实是：客户端信号因浏览器主动反指纹而熵下降，服务端信号反而更耐操。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>代表熵源</th>\n<th>熵</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n<th>2026 主要漂移/限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬件/OS 层</td>\n<td>屏幕参数、<code>platform</code>、CPU 核数、设备内存</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>跨浏览器一致，但易被反检测浏览器覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器版本层</td>\n<td>UA、Client Hints（<code>Sec-CH-UA</code>）、已装字体集</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>版本升级即漂移，需持续重建基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时渲染层</td>\n<td>Canvas 像素哈希、WebGL 渲染器串、AudioContext 尾数</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Safari/Firefox 的 farbling/letterboxing 主动降熵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端传输层</td>\n<td>JA4 TLS 指纹、HTTP/2 帧序、ALPN</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>TLS 库升级会改变指纹，需版本化基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络层</td>\n<td>ASN、IP 信誉、住宅/移动代理类型</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>代理池轮换快，单点不可靠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Canvas 指纹的经典做法（Mowery 与 Shacham 于 2012 年提出）是绘制一段文本加渐变，读出像素级哈希；它之所以有效，是 GPU、驱动、字体抗锯齿、亚像素渲染的细微差异。但这项技术已被 Safari 与 Firefox 的随机化噪声削弱，2026 年它更多是<strong>低权重佐证</strong>而非主键；<code>WEBGL_debug_renderer_info</code> 在主流浏览器里也逐步被限制或返回通用值。</p>\n<p>熵的量化不用等到线上：给定属性在样本上的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其香农熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H=-\\sum p_i\\log_2 p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（bit）；整条指纹在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个样本规模下的碰撞率近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>collision</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{collision}}\\approx 1-e^{-n^{2}/(2H_{\\text{total}})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">collision</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0369em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0369em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这解释了为什么指纹必须聚类而非唯一标识：总熵只有 20–30 比特、用户规模到千万级时，碰撞是数学必然。更稳的做法是把指纹建模成一组 <code>(属性, 值)</code> 的稀疏向量，用 Jaccard 或余弦相似度匹配，并做<strong>自洽性校验</strong>——反检测浏览器能伪造 Canvas，但很难同时让 WebGL 渲染器串、字体枚举顺序、<code>hardwareConcurrency</code> 与 UA 声明的平台全部自洽。EFF 的 Cover Your Tracks 与 AmIUnique（Laperdrix 等，IEEE S&amp;P 2016《Beauty and the Beast》）是公开可复现的熵测量工具，可作为基线校验的参照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设备身份图谱的构建\">设备身份图谱的构建</h2><p>图谱的建模质量决定后续所有判定的上限。跨境电商的身份图通常包含以下节点与边类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点类型</th>\n<th>归一化要点</th>\n<th>常见边来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设备（visitorId）</td>\n<td>指纹聚类后的稳定 ID，非原始哈希</td>\n<td>同账号多次登录、同 IP 段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账号</td>\n<td>内部主键</td>\n<td>登录、改绑、下单事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮箱</td>\n<td>小写化 + 去点 + 分域哈希</td>\n<td>注册、找回、通知退信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手机号</td>\n<td>E.164 归一</td>\n<td>验证码、SMS 验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IP / ASN</td>\n<td>存 /24 或 ASN 而非原始 IP</td>\n<td>同会话、同时间窗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付工具</td>\n<td>BIN + 卡指纹（不可逆哈希）</td>\n<td>支付尝试、退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话/Cookie</td>\n<td>加盐哈希，不存原始值</td>\n<td>同一浏览器容器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>构建流程分四步。第一，<strong>实体解析</strong>：新请求的特征向量与图中已有设备节点做相似度匹配，超过阈值即复用节点，否则新建。第二，<strong>边生成与打分</strong>：一次事件内的实体两两建边，权重用上文 LLR；对高度数节点做 TF 归一化，避免一个公司出口 IP 或公共 WiFi 把五千台设备连成团。第三，<strong>连通分量</strong>：用并查集（Union-Find / DSU）在线增量合并「同一设备」「同一账号」的等价类，这是 O(α(n)) 的近常数操作，适合百万级 QPS 的登录链路。第四，<strong>时间衰减</strong>：历史边不能永久有效，权重按指数衰减</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(t)=w_0\\cdot e^{-\\lambda (t-t_0)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 对应半衰期：设得短，长期潜伏的慢速攻击者会被「洗白」；设得长，一台重装过系统的正常设备会被永久打标。这个参数与账号信任模型直接耦合——信任等级高的账号，其历史边衰减更快；新账号的高风险边衰减更慢。</p>\n<p>图谱最容易踩的坑是<strong>图爆炸</strong>：阈值过松会让整张图退化成单一巨型连通分量，判定力归零。防守手段是组合约束——边权阈值、节点度上限、社区规模上限，以及「合并必须可解释」。图存储上，千万节点/亿级边既可用图数据库（Neo4j、JanusGraph、TigerGraph），也可用宽表 + 邻接表 + 内存 DSU；跨境电商因跨国部署，通常按区域分图后再做轻度跨区同步，以免 GDPR 数据本地化与延迟同时恶化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图谱上的风险判定-连通分量-社区与标签扩散\">图谱上的风险判定：连通分量、社区与标签扩散</h2><p>建好图之后，判定问题就变成了图上的一组标准算法。撞库与羊毛本质都是 <strong>Sybil 攻击</strong>——一个控制者操纵大量账号；Sybil 检测的经典解法是从高置信的「坏种子」（已确认欺诈账号、命中已知泄露口令、已被拉黑的设备）出发做带重启的随机游走，把风险沿边扩散：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>W</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{r}=\\alpha\\left(I-(1-\\alpha)W\\right)^{-1}\\vec{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.204em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是种子向量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是列归一化的邻接矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是重启概率（常取 0.15–0.3）。节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 值即「与已知坏种子的关联强度」，可直接作为风控分的一部分。</p>\n<p>在此基础上叠加三类拓扑特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>度分布异常</strong>：正常用户近似「一账号少数设备」，攻击集群呈现「一账号多设备」或「一设备多账号」的星型/双星结构，可对二部图做一模型投影后看聚类系数与 k-core。</li>\n<li><strong>社区检测</strong>：用 Louvain 或标签传播找高密度子图。撞库集群在图谱上通常是一个内部边类型集中（IP 段 + 会话序列 + 指纹）、而账号的邮箱域分布异常集中的子图。</li>\n<li><strong>共享稀缺资源</strong>：同一支付工具被 N 个陌生账号使用、同一收货地址被 M 个国家账号使用，这类「稀缺资源复用」是跨境场景中最强的信号之一。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对抗是持续的。攻击者知道图谱存在后，会刻意压低共享性——每账号配独立住宅 IP、指纹喷洒、每卡一账号——但这直接抬高单位成本，把撞库的成本推到不划算就是防御的胜利。反过来，误伤预算必须提前算清：跨境电商里家庭共享设备、办公出口 IP、公共 WiFi、代购商家都是「天然高连通」的正常用户，图判定必须可解释、可申诉，且申诉结果要能回写图谱（拆开误合并的节点）。判别阈值落地的做法与<a href=\"bot-detection-signal-taxonomy\">登录机器人检测信号分类与对抗演进</a>中的分层一致：高置信拓扑证据直接挑战，中置信只提升认证等级，与账号信任等级模型的对接见<a href=\"../ato-threat-account-trust/account-trust-level-model\">账号信任等级模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私合规-移动端信号与跨境电商落地\">隐私合规、移动端信号与跨境电商落地</h2><p>设备指纹在欧盟被明确纳入法律射程：ePrivacy 指令第 5(3) 条覆盖「在终端设备上存储或访问信息」，EDPB 的《Guidelines 2/2023 on the technical scope of Art. 5(3)》确认设备指纹属于该技术范围，因此原则上需要事先同意或落入豁免。反欺诈通常被判为「合法利益」（GDPR 第 6(1)(f) 条）而非「严格必要」豁免，需要做平衡测试（LIA）并保留退出路径；法国 CNIL 在其 cookie 与追踪器建议中同样把指纹与 Cookie 同等对待。落到工程上是四条纪律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数据最小化</strong>：指纹值加盐哈希后存储并定期轮换盐；IP 只存 /24 或 ASN；图谱边设保留期限，过期自动衰减删除。</li>\n<li><strong>用户权利可执行</strong>：「删除」必须能从图谱中移除节点及其派生边，社区标签这类派生数据要能基于剩余图重建。</li>\n<li><strong>分档投放</strong>：匿名浏览不采集行为数据，只在登录、注册、改绑、支付等敏感动作启用完整信号栈，把隐私面缩到最小。</li>\n<li><strong>可解释与可申诉</strong>：给用户和客服的判定说明要走图谱证据（「此设备与已知欺诈设备共享支付工具」），而不是一句「你像机器人」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>移动端是跨境电商的另一半战场，且约束更硬。iOS 14.5 起 IDFA 需经 App Tracking Transparency 同意才可获取；Android 10 起禁止应用读取 IMEI（<code>READ_PHONE_STATE</code> 受限）。这两个曾经的「稳定设备 ID」已不可用，替代方案是平台完整性信号：Google Play Integrity API 返回 <code>MEETS_DEVICE_INTEGRITY</code> / <code>MEETS_STRONG_INTEGRITY</code> 等裁决，Apple 的 App Attest 与 DeviceCheck（<code>DCAppAttestService</code>、<code>DCDevice</code>）用于判断设备是否被 root/越狱或应用是否被篡改。关键认知是：<strong>这些是「设备是否可信」的布尔裁决，本身不是稳定标识</strong>，不能拿来当设备 ID 用——把它们当作图谱上的一个高权重属性节点，而不是主键。</p>\n<p>最后是采集成本与路径选择。Google 在 2025 年 4 月宣布不再弃用第三方 Cookie（Privacy Sandbox 策略调整），意味着依赖第三方 Cookie 做跨站身份仍不可靠，图谱必须建立在<strong>第一方信号</strong>（登录态、邮箱、支付工具、服务端传输层指纹）之上。服务端信号（JA4、HTTP/2 帧序、IP 信誉）不依赖客户端执行 JS，跨境弱网用户零延迟代价，应当优先承担主判据；客户端指纹脚本则要控制在关键路径之外、无感执行。若图谱中存有支付工具哈希，其存储方式需同时满足 PCI DSS v4.0 对支付账户数据的要求；NIST SP 800-63B（Rev. 4）关于会话标识符熵值与轮换的底线，同样是图谱与会话安全共享的地板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>设备指纹与设备身份图谱是同一套防护的两个尺度：指纹回答「这台设备像不像它声称的自己」，图谱回答「这群账号背后是不是同一个人」。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指纹是概率信号，不是身份</strong>：总熵常在 20–30 比特，千万级用户下碰撞必然发生，必须用相似度聚类 + 字段自洽性校验，而非单点哈希。</li>\n<li><strong>按漂移速度分层</strong>：硬件/OS 层稳定、渲染层熵高但易漂移、服务端传输层最耐操；客户端反指纹（farbling、letterboxing）已让 Canvas/WebGL 降权，服务端信号成为主判据。</li>\n<li><strong>图谱的价值在关系</strong>：单点可伪造（代理轮换、指纹喷洒），关系难伪造（一账号多设备、稀缺支付工具复用）。</li>\n<li><strong>LLR 建边、DSU 合并、随机游走扩散</strong>：对数似然比给可解释的边权，并查集做近常数等价类合并，Personalized PageRank 从坏种子扩散风险；时间衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 必须与账号信任等级耦合。</li>\n<li><strong>图爆炸是最常见失效</strong>：边权阈值、度数上限、社区规模上限三者缺一不可。</li>\n<li><strong>合规是设计约束</strong>：ePrivacy 5(3) 与 EDPB Guidelines 2/2023 覆盖指纹，需同意或合法利益 + LIA；移动端 IDFA/IMEI 已不可依赖，改用 Play Integrity / App Attest 作为属性而非 ID。</li>\n<li><strong>可解释与可申诉</strong>：跨境电商的家庭共享、办公出口、代购商户是天然高连通用户，图谱判定必须能逐条列出证据并接受申诉回写。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参见本章目录 <a href=\"./\"><code>./INDEX.md</code></a> 了解本节其余文档的组织方式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"设备指纹技术与设备身份图谱构建","id":"设备指纹技术与设备身份图谱构建"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：指纹是概率，图谱是聚合器","id":"核心概念-指纹是概率-图谱是聚合器"},{"level":2,"text":"指纹熵源与稳定性分层","id":"指纹熵源与稳定性分层"},{"level":2,"text":"设备身份图谱的构建","id":"设备身份图谱的构建"},{"level":2,"text":"图谱上的风险判定：连通分量、社区与标签扩散","id":"图谱上的风险判定-连通分量-社区与标签扩散"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私合规、移动端信号与跨境电商落地","id":"隐私合规-移动端信号与跨境电商落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"登录机器人检测信号分类与对抗演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/account-takeover-credential-stuffing-bot-defense/login-bot-detection-fingerprint/bot-detection-signal-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"机器人缓解策略灰度上线与误杀调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/account-takeover-credential-stuffing-bot-defense/login-bot-detection-fingerprint/bot-mitigation-rollout-tuning"}}